      "id": "alice-launch-fix",
      "name": "爱丽丝快跑启动修复",
      "category": "patches",
      "os": "ARMv7 · rootful 越狱",
      "tagline": "保护异常的网络响应，恢复游戏启动。",
      "description": "针对中文版 RushingAliceCN 2.40，在网络响应抛出异常时保护客户端，避免直接闪退。",
      "notes": [
        "实测 iPad 3 / iOS 9.3.6；其他系统和设备需另行验证。",
        "仅提供独立修复补丁，不附带原游戏或内置补丁游戏包。",
        "不能恢复已关闭的在线服务。安装后彻底退出游戏再打开。"
      ],
      "versions": [
        {
          "version": "1.0.0",
          "files": [
            {
              "path": "deb/local.luoxian.aliceresponseguard_1.0.0_iphoneos-arm.deb",
              "size": 4430,
              "sha256": "2966809bf2eb51925cf670f158cc46f7a89151b8f0441ef7e77de4fe6ac3fe85",
              "type": "deb",
              "label": "DEB 安装包",
              "control": {
                "Package": "local.luoxian.aliceresponseguard",
                "Name": "Alice Run Launch Fix",
                "Version": "1.0.0",
                "Architecture": "iphoneos-arm",
                "Maintainer": "luoxian",
                "Section": "Tweaks",
                "Priority": "optional",
                "Depends": "mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 11.0)",
                "Description": "Guard a failing network response callback in RushingAliceCN.\n Targets the Chinese Alice Run game (bundle RushingAliceCN), tested with version 2.40 on iPad 3 / iOS 9.3.6.\n ARMv7, rootful jailbreak only. Other devices and iOS versions need testing.\n Cancels a request when MIXCacheHandler throws an Objective-C exception.\n Does not restore unavailable online services. Quit and reopen the game after installing or removing."
              }
